Thought: I'll first get a list of common oxide compositions to work with. Let's use some representative oxide compositions.
Action: batch_retrieve_polymorphs
Action Input: {"compositions": ["TiO2", "Al2O3", "Fe2O3", "ZnO", "MgO", "CuO", "NiO", "MnO2", "Cr2O3", "V2O5"], "max_energy_above_hull": 0.3, "max_per_composition": 3, "save_directory": "oxide_polymorphs"}

Thought: Great, we have successfully retrieved polymorph data for all compositions. Now let's consolidate this data into a single dataset.
Action: consolidate_polymorph_datasets
Action Input: {"composition_files": {"TiO2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/TiO2_polymorphs.json", "Al2O3": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/Al2O3_polymorphs.json", "Fe2O3": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/Fe2O3_polymorphs.json", "ZnO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/ZnO_polymorphs.json", "MgO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/MgO_polymorphs.json", "CuO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/CuO_polymorphs.json", "NiO": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/NiO_polymorphs.json", "MnO2": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/MnO2_polymorphs.json", "Cr2O3": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/Cr2O3_polymorphs.json", "V2O5": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/oxide_polymorphs/V2O5_polymorphs.json"}, "output_path": "consolidated_oxides.json"}

Thought: Now that we have consolidated the data, let's prepare the tabular dataset for machine learning with advanced feature engineering and the specified test split.
Action: prepare_tabular_dataset
Action Input: {"polymorphs_json_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/consolidated_oxides.json", "output_path": "ml_dataset", "target_property": "formation_energy_per_atom", "feature_engineering": "advanced", "test_split": 0.2, "normalize": true}

Thought: Now let's train the XGBoost model with the specified hyperparameters.
Action: train_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/ml_dataset/train.csv", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/ml_dataset/test.csv", "model_save_path": "xgboost_model.json", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Let's now evaluate the model with detailed analysis and perform cross-validation to get comprehensive performance metrics.
Action: evaluate_xgboost_model
Action Input: {"model_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/xgboost_model.json", "test_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/ml_dataset/test.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "detailed_analysis": true}

Thought: Let's proceed with cross-validation since we encountered an error with the detailed evaluation. We'll use the specified hyperparameters and CV folds.
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/0_ml_claude_react/ml_oxides_trial_1/ml_dataset/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5, "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}

Thought: Now I have all the necessary results to create the final JSON output. I'll combine the test set evaluation metrics from the training results and the cross-validation results into the required format.
Action: write_file
Action Input: {"path": "model_evaluation_results.json", "content": {"test_set_evaluation": {"mae": 0.40431485315456256, "rmse": 0.6203506248818522, "r2": 0.21611017515354736, "feature_importance": {"density": 0.24326522648334503, "volume": 0.01122156623750925, "nsites": 0.4193888306617737, "band_gap": 0.0734647661447525, "energy_above_hull": 0.02876114472746849, "lattice_a": 0.003474991302937269, "lattice_b": 0.03391018509864807, "lattice_c": 0.005347146652638912, "lattice_alpha": 0.007180074695497751, "lattice_beta": 0.01467832364141941, "lattice_gamma": 0.00022572785383090377, "lattice_volume": 0.0, "num_species": 0.0, "packing_efficiency": 0.09473644196987152, "space_group_number": 0.0014405256370082498, "crystal_system": 0.00016546940605621785, "num_elements": 0.0, "electronegativity_diff": 0.06273949891328812}}, "cross_validation_results": {"r2_mean": -0.6603380009996521, "r2_std": 2.9003916814047948}}}
